  "title": "Broadstone Net Lease Schedules Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "VICTOR, N.Y. – Broadstone Net Lease, Inc. (NYSE: BNL) (“Broadstone,” “BNL,” the “Company,” “we,” “our,” or “us”), today announced that it will release its financial and operating results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, after the market closes on Wednesday, July 29, 2026. The Company will host its earnings conference call and audio webcast […]",
